message: If you use the QSense Motion platform in your research, please cite it as below.
title: QSense Motion - wireless IMU motion capture platform
abstract: Documentation, APIs and code examples for integrating the QSense wireless IMU motion sensor platform, covering the sensor and dongle interfaces, C#/.NET and Swift libraries and Python examples. Platform documentation, specifications and support are available at https://qsense-motion.com
type: software
